# ImmuniSOC-Nexus Quick Setup

The following secrets are required for the system to start.
Ensure they are at least 16 characters long and complex (mixed case, numbers, special characters).

HANDSHAKE_SECRET_TOKEN=NexusHandshake@2026!Secret
SECURITY_ADMIN_TOKEN=AdminNexus#2026#SecureAccess
JWT_SECRET=JWT-Nexus!2026!GlobalSecretKey
ENCRYPTION_KEY=EncKey-Nexus*2026*SecureData
LOG_SECRET=Log-Nexus%2026%ImmutableChain

# Network configuration
PROXY_PORT=8080
BACKEND_URL=http://backend:8081
OPA_URL=http://opa:8181

# Rate limiting
RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=100
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW=1m

# Images
OPA_IMAGE=openpolicyagent/opa:latest
